		<title>WE&#8217;RE IN NYC PLAYING THE LIGHTUP &amp; AAIFF MUSIC NIGHT OUT PARTY (FRI AUG 12)</title>
		<link>http://bluescholars.com/were-in-nyc-playing-the-lightup-aaiff-music-night-out-party-fri-aug-12/</link>
		<comments>http://bluescholars.com/were-in-nyc-playing-the-lightup-aaiff-music-night-out-party-fri-aug-12/#comments</comments>
		<pubDate>Fri, 12 Aug 2011 17:11:50 +0000</pubDate>
		<dc:creator>Geo</dc:creator>
				<category><![CDATA[Events]]></category>

		<guid isPermaLink="false">http://bluescholars.com/?p=3426</guid>
		<description><![CDATA[<p></p>
<p>We&#8217;re back in NYC this weekend for the <a href="http://bluescholars.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2011/08/aaiff2011_musicnightout-1.jpg">Asian American International Film Festival</a>. Come party with us at <a href="http://www.dromnyc.com/events/1099/asian-american-film-festival-party"><strong>Drom</strong> in the East Village</a> - we&#8217;ll be screening our latest music video, <strong><a href="http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=PJLZQVRMzYM">Fou Lee</a></strong>, and rocking a set of new&#8230; <a href="http://bluescholars.com/were-in-nyc-playing-the-lightup-aaiff-music-night-out-party-fri-aug-12/" class="read_more">More</a></p>]]></description>
			<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p><img class="size-full wp-image-3427 alignleft" title="aaiff2011_musicnightout-1" src="http://bluescholars.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2011/08/aaiff2011_musicnightout-1.jpg" alt="" width="450" height="583" /></p>
<p>We&#8217;re back in NYC this weekend for the <a href="http://bluescholars.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2011/08/aaiff2011_musicnightout-1.jpg">Asian American International Film Festival</a>. Come party with us at <a href="http://www.dromnyc.com/events/1099/asian-american-film-festival-party"><strong>Drom</strong> in the East Village</a> - we&#8217;ll be screening our latest music video, <strong><a href="http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=PJLZQVRMzYM">Fou Lee</a></strong>, and rocking a set of new joints off <strong><em>Cinemetropolis</em></strong>.</p>
<blockquote><p><strong>LIGHTUP FILM&#8217;S MUSIC NIGHT OUT</strong></p>
<p>Friday, August 12<br />
10:00pm</p>
<p>Drom<br />
85 Ave A (btw 5th &amp; 6th Sts)<br />
New York, NY</p>
<p>FEATURING BLUE SCHOLARS &amp; JESSE BOYKINS III</p>
<p>Come out to the best party of the Festival! The perfect union of music and film at AAIFF’s annual music video showcase plus live performance.</p>
<p>Featuring new music videos from independent artists and performances by the acclaimed hip hop duo Blue Scholars and Jesse Boykins III, a BET award nominated world soul singer. The evening is curated by LightUp Film, a full service independent media and production company.</p>
<p>*This event is 21+*</p></blockquote>
]]></content:encoded>
