		<link>http://bluescholars.com/video-live-at-kexp-6152011/</link>
		<comments>http://bluescholars.com/video-live-at-kexp-6152011/#comments</comments>
		<pubDate>Sun, 17 Jul 2011 22:36:35 +0000</pubDate>
