		<guid isPermaLink="false">http://bluescholars.com/blog/?p=3400</guid>
		<description><![CDATA[Video of live in-studio performances of songs off Cinemetropolis at KEXP 90.3 FM.]]></description>
			<content:encoded><![CDATA[<div id="attachment_3401" class="wp-caption alignnone" style="width: 510px"><a href="http://bluescholars.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2011/08/5893077258_088613ac57.jpg"><img class="size-full wp-image-3401 " title="Blue Scholars" src="http://bluescholars.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2011/08/5893077258_088613ac57.jpg" alt="" width="500" height="333" /></a><p class="wp-caption-text">photo by David Lictherman</p></div>
<p>We hit up KEXP, played some songs off Cinemetropolis, and they filmed the whole thang. Check the videos below and <a href="http://blog.kexp.org/blog/2011/07/18/live-video-blue-scholars/">show some love to KEXP</a>.</p>
