		<item>
		<title>BACK IN THE HI-808!</title>
		<link>http://bluescholars.com/back-in-the-hi-808/</link>
		<comments>http://bluescholars.com/back-in-the-hi-808/#comments</comments>
		<pubDate>Thu, 30 Jun 2011 05:19:21 +0000</pubDate>
		<dc:creator>Geo</dc:creator>
				<category><![CDATA[Tourdates]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[Bambu]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[Blue Scholars]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[Hawaii]]></category>

		<guid isPermaLink="false">http://bluescholars.com/blog/?p=3336</guid>
		<description><![CDATA[We're back in Hawai'i for a minute. Catch us at The Loft (Honolulu) w/ Bambu on Saturday, July 6 and hit the link for more events.]]></description>
			<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p><a rel="attachment wp-att-3337" href="http://bluescholars.com/blog/back-in-the-hi-808/tumblr_lnevuh7jwc1qdestjo1_500/"><img class="size-full wp-image-3337 alignnone" title="tumblr_lnevuh7JWc1qdestjo1_500" src="http://bluescholars.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2011/06/tumblr_lnevuh7JWc1qdestjo1_500.jpg" alt="" width="415" height="641" /></a></p>
<p>We&#8217;re all back in Hawai&#8217;i for the first time since the <a href="http://02cd02a.netsolhost.com/blog/releases/oof-ep/">OOF! EP</a> release tour.</p>
<p>It gets active starting on Wednesday, July 6, kicking off with the <strong><a href="http://www.in4mants.com/hi/blog/prometheus-brown-bambu-walk-into-a-bar-album-release/">Prometheus Brown &amp; Bambu Walk Into A Bar in-store release party at In4mation Pearlridge</a></strong> from 4-5pm (all-ages, free!). From the 6th through the 8th, we&#8217;ll be posted up at the University of Hawaii-Manoa presenting workshops at the <strong><a href="http://essahawaii.tumblr.com/post/7171107630/rise-up-represent-july-6-8th-the-native">Rise Up! Represent! Student Conference</a></strong> (hit the link to register). To cap off the week, we&#8217;re rocking the <strong><a href="http://bluescholars.com/blog/tour-dates/">The Loft on Saturday night with Bambu, Omega Cix, DJ Packo and more</a></strong>.</p>
<p>Keep up with the crew on this trip via twitter: <a href="http://twitter.com/bluescholars">@bluescholars</a>, <a href="http://twitter.com/prometheusbrown">@prometheusbrown</a>, <a href="http://twitter.com/sabzi">@sabzi</a>, <a href="http://twitter.com/wongweezy">@wongweezy</a>, <a href="http://twitter.com/canhsolo">@canhsolo</a>.</p>
<p>In the meantime, <a href="http://www.youtube.com/prometheusbrown#g/c/2EE0FCE86107F7F2">check out video clips from the last Blue Scholars HI trip</a>.</p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
]]></content:encoded>
